# DMARC Analytics Web Client Environment Configuration

# Map Tile Provider Settings:
# NOTE: The default map layers (Dark Canvas, Light Canvas, OpenStreetMap, Satellite)
# are 100% FREE and do NOT require any API key!
#
# If you wish to enable CARTO Dark Matter tiles:
# 1. Sign up for a free key at: https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
# 2. Paste the key below (or enter it in the UI via the "API Key" button on the map):
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=
